# Data Model
The dataset was modeled using a Star Schema approach in Power BI. Where multiple fact tables share common dimension tables.

# The model consists of:
# Fact Table
* Fact Inventory
* Fact Procurement
* Fact Production
* Fact Sales
* Fact Shipment

# Dimension Table
* Dimension Product
* Dimension Supplier
* Dimension Customer
* Dimension Facility
* Dimension Date

